Due to the periodic requests for sources to zork (a.k.a. dungeon),
I will post what I have.  What will follow is the DECUS dungeon
converted from DEC FORTRAN to Unix f77 and subsequently modified
to run on a Vax (as opposed to a pdp-11).  The source and docs
will be posted in 7 parts to net.sources.games.  Following that,
the data files will be posted in 7 parts, uuencoded (there is no
source for the main data file, only binary).

Be patient as the distribution will take place over a period of
time in chunks smaller than 64K to avoid choking mailers, etc.

Note also that the copyright states that this can not be used for
commercial purposes.

I also have a version that will run on a pdp-11 with split I/D;
send mail for info on this (if anyone still uses pdp's :-).
